docs {
Trigger backup full DB encrypted ke repo sambasku/sqlite via workflow_dispatch.
Hanya admin/root. Rate limit 5/menit.

Alur: API INSERT log status=pending -> dispatch workflow (input log_id) -> UPDATE processing.
CI sqlite meng-UPDATE baris log_id yang sama ke succeeded / failed saat selesai.
Poll GET /backups untuk status akhir.

202 accepted:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "accepted": true,
        "log_id": "01J…",
        "status": "processing",
        "dry_run": false
      }
    }

503 SQLITE_BACKUP_UNAVAILABLE jika PUBLIC_IMAGE_GITHUB_TOKEN / PRONUNCIACION_GITHUB_TOKEN kosong.
502 SQLITE_BACKUP_UPSTREAM jika GitHub menolak dispatch (baris log ditandai failed).
409 SQLITE_BACKUP_IN_PROGRESS jika masih ada backup pending/processing (< 30 menit).
}

meta {
  name: Trigger Database Backup
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/system/database/backup
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "dry_run": false
  }
}

tests {
  test("status 202 atau 409/502/503 tergantung env", () => {
    expect([202, 409, 502, 503]).to.include(res.status);
    expect(res.body.success).to.be.a('boolean');
    if (res.status === 202) {
      expect(res.body.data.log_id).to.be.a('string');
      expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal('processing');
    }
  });
}
